{"unit_id":"tag:0948:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节研究赋环位点（ringed site）上的模（modules）的导出范畴（derived category）中的紧对象（compact objects）。回顾一下，紧对象（compact objects）定义于\n导出范畴（Derived Categories），定义 <REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"compact objects","target_term":"紧对象"},{"source_term":"compact objects","target_term":"紧对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"本节的基"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"导出范畴的系数"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"紧性的环境"},{"source_term":"compact objects","target_term":"紧对象","context":"本节研究对象"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"章节引用"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:094B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）。设\n<MATH_0002> 为一对象（objects）集（set），满足\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> 的任意对象（object）都是\n<MATH_0004> 中元素（elements）的直和（direct sum）的商（quotient），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意 <MATH_0005>，函子（functor）<MATH_0006>\n与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则 <MATH_0007> 的每个紧（compact）对象（object）都是\n<MATH_0008> 中的一个直和因子（direct summand），其所在复形（complex）为有限（finite）复形（complex），各项为\n<MATH_0009> 中元素（elements）的有限（finite）直和（direct sums）。\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"compact","target_term":"紧"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴","context":"Grothendieck 范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"生成对象集"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集","context":"生成对象集"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"任意输入及紧性"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"生成对象"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和","context":"商的来源"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"生成性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"与直和交